3. + lib/Thoran/String/Captures/captures.rb: Thoran::String::Captures#captures 0.3.0, required by MacOS/HardwarePort.rb and MacOS/IfConfig.rb.
4. + lib/String/to_regexp.rb: String#to_regexp 0.3.0, required by MacOS/IfConfig.rb.
